# concept/index.html, mobile-new.html, mobile-current.html and quiz.html are
# BUILT by build/build.py + build/build_mobile.py. Each one is ~6MB of inlined
# base64, so committing them would add a fresh 6MB blob to the repo on every
# rebuild. Two commands regenerate them in a couple of seconds:
#
#   python3 build/build.py
#   python3 build/build_mobile.py
#
# concept/v6_baseline.html IS committed — it is the source the build starts
# from, not an output.
concept/index.html
concept/mobile-new.html
concept/mobile-current.html
concept/mobile-new-big.html
concept/dumb.co-review.html
concept/quiz.html
